OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust issue plea as critical
OL,4,Aincident continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, it also advised people
OL,7,Fto collect their relatives promptly if
OL,8,Fthey get discharged from hospital, and
OL,9,Fto only call 999 or attend the
OL,10,Femergency department if they are in a
OL,11,Fserious or life-threatening condition.
